  "aligns": "N/A",
  "effect": "Proposes to relieve the burden by specifying that, when using physical containment as a hazard control strategy, operators do not need to develop flight hazard areas in accordance with FAA's existing flight hazard area analysis requirements",
  "alignment_notes": "Streamlines launch approvals, but focuses primarily on airspace safety rather than orbital lifecycle tracking or on-orbit maneuver intent",
